{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"A confirmed merge can leave the status tool reporting that the PR needs review or that its state is unknown."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A subsequent push can stale an acknowledged approval while the digest omits the newly required review."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"The digest can direct an agent to review a PR while the factory is still making requested changes."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Closing a PR after a blocked landing leaves status recommending a landing retry that the queue refuses."},{"id":"C5","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An unreadable privacy policy lets a mutation succeed while hiding its receipt, potentially causing duplicate work."},{"id":"C6","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An unavailable privacy policy causes status to succeed without providing the requested state or next action."},{"id":"C8","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A valid approval with no saved PR observation is incorrectly reported as requiring another review."},{"id":"C10","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"During the window between opening a PR and finishing its run, the digest advertises a review that the API refuses."},{"id":"C11","consequence":"diag","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A lookup for an unknown run returns an inaccurate HTTP error classification while retaining the correct error message."},{"id":"C12","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"Following the Codex skill's documented command reads Claude's cursor and can omit work unread by Codex."},{"id":"C13","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A malfunctioning backend can return a malformed review or land receipt that MCP reports as successful."}]}